  "qualification": {
    "category": "not a fit",
    "rationale": "Ardent Industries Inc. is a precision metal fabrication, CNC machining, welding, and powder coating manufacturing business. ForgeX exclusively serves owner-led home-service contractors (HVAC, plumbing, and electrical) that pay for service dispatch leads. Because this company is an industrial contract manufacturer and e-commerce parts seller rather than a field-service trade contractor, it does not match ForgeX's target profile."
  }
